  "description": "<p>This inspirational area rug features a faith floral design, adding a meaningful touch to any space. Crafted for comfort and durability, it serves as both a decorative accent and a functional floor covering. Its versatile nature makes it suitable for enhancing various rooms with spiritual elegance and coziness.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft and comfortable feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant for lasting beauty.</li>\n<li>Versatile for home and church use, including prayer or meditation areas.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name or special message.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gamer Room, Reading Nook, Entryway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Christian, Faith, Inspirational</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester Fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning, machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This personalized rug is ideal for creating a serene and inviting atmosphere in bedrooms, living rooms, and entryways. It also serves beautifully in offices, gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, or as a decorative piece in church settings and meditation corners, fostering an environment of peace and reflection.</p>",
